id: wild-counter
name: Wild Counter
talentCategory: counter
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Able to defend and attack in the same motion, you respond to being attacked with an attack of your own!
text: >
  Wild Counter: Able to defend and attack in the same motion, you respond to being attacked with an attack of your own!
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you successfully avoid an Attacking Maneuver through the Parry effect of the Defend Maneuver, you can use the Basic Attack Maneuver against the attacking Opponent as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Parry that turned the attack aside: the Basic Attack at its maker offered on its card, out of sequence, beside the
# Reflect and Attack Absorption - taken, once a Round (chat.mjs offerWildCounter).
allow counter.wild;
